Description: MSM backend for libgbm (runtime library)
 This package provides the MSM backend library which enables GBM buffer
 management support when using Qualcomm graphics driver.
 .
 This package provides the runtime library.

Package: libgbm-msm-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: arm64
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
Description: MSM backend for libgbm (development files)
 This package provides the MSM backend library which enables GBM buffer
 management support when using Qualcomm graphics driver.
 .
 This package provides files necessary to develop programs using the library.
